{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538524323,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be925ffe6LNNMoIS3b6D11","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2d4cae8001iQ7cgi01aC2f2u","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be925ffe6LNNMoIS3b6D11","messageID":"msg_1d2d4b8ae001k3LArE10p7NwJI","type":"tool","id":"call_991bcef6105a489a957f77c9","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"^#|^##\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md | head -60; wc -l .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},"output":"7:# Skill Advisor Install + Setup Guide\n13:## 0. AI-FIRST SETUP GUIDE\n40:## 1. OVERVIEW\n46:## 2. PREREQUISITES\n57:## 3. INSTALLATION\n76:## 4. VERIFICATION\n97:## 5. PACKAGE CHECKS\n116:## 6. RUNTIME HOOKS AND PLUGIN\n138:## 7. COMPAT SHIMS\n167:## 8. ROLLBACK\n179:# Disable prompt-time advisor surfaces and native recommendation output.\n182:# Keep hooks enabled but force Python compatibility where supported.\n185:# CLI-only Python path.\n198:## 9. OPERATOR CHECKS\n225:### Indexer scan-vs-index counts\n233:## 10. TROUBLESHOOTING\n242:## 11. REFERENCE COMMANDS\n245:# Build and typecheck the runtime package\n249:# Advisor health and recommendation through the CLI\n253:# Trusted graph mutation\n256:# Python local scorer, direct\n261:# Native required\n264:# Python fallback required\n267:# Regression compatibility\n274:## 12. CHOOSING AN EMBEDDER\n278:### 12.1 Current active default\n293:### 12.2 Registered alternatives\n311:### 12.3 Swap mechanism: `'auto'` sentinel + `setActiveEmbedder()`\n337:### 12.4 Operator-safe swap runbook\n349:### 12.5 Device selection\n361:### 12.6 Cross-references\n371:## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\n383:## 14. TUNING THE ADVISOR\n387:### 14.1 Quick tuning (no rebuild) — recommended for external clones\n401:### 14.2 Full tuning: `/doctor:skill-advisor tune`\n414:### 14.3 What tuning touches\n424:### 14.4 Tuning rollback\n     440 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"7:# Skill Advisor Install + Setup Guide\n13:## 0. AI-FIRST SETUP GUIDE\n40:## 1. OVERVIEW\n46:## 2. PREREQUISITES\n57:## 3. INSTALLATION\n76:## 4. VERIFICATION\n97:## 5. PACKAGE CHECKS\n116:## 6. RUNTIME HOOKS AND PLUGIN\n138:## 7. COMPAT SHIMS\n167:## 8. ROLLBACK\n179:# Disable prompt-time advisor surfaces and native recommendation output.\n182:# Keep hooks enabled but force Python compatibility where supported.\n185:# CLI-only Python path.\n198:## 9. OPERATOR CHECKS\n225:### Indexer scan-vs-index counts\n233:## 10. TROUBLESHOOTING\n242:## 11. REFERENCE COMMANDS\n245:# Build and typecheck the runtime package\n249:# Advisor health and recommendation through the CLI\n253:# Trusted graph mutation\n256:# Python local scorer, direct\n261:# Native required\n264:# Python fallback required\n267:# Regression compatibility\n274:## 12. CHOOSING AN EMBEDDER\n278:### 12.1 Current active default\n293:### 12.2 Registered alternatives\n311:### 12.3 Swap mechanism: `'auto'` sentinel + `setActiveEmbedder()`\n337:### 12.4 Operator-safe swap runbook\n349:### 12.5 Device selection\n361:### 12.6 Cross-references\n371:## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\n383:## 14. TUNING THE ADVISOR\n387:### 14.1 Quick tuning (no rebuild) — recommended for external clones\n401:### 14.2 Full tuning: `/doctor:skill-advisor tune`\n414:### 14.3 What tuning touches\n424:### 14.4 Tuning rollback\n     440 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"^#|^##\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md | head -60; wc -l .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538523368,"end":1794538524323}}}}
