ost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server, so answering no leaves a phrase-only install.\n \n ---\n \n ## 3. INSTALLATION\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\",\"oldString\":\"- The local shared package at `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/shared` is present; `npm install` links it into `runtime/node_modules/@spec-kit/shared`.\",\"newString\":\"- The local shared package at `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/shared` is present; `npm install` links it into `runtime/node_modules/@spec-kit/shared`.\\n- `/doctor:install` sets up the embedder by default: its checklist includes `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder`, which prints the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server, so answering no leaves a phrase-only install.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538590148,"end":1794538591454}}}}
