{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538599207,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be925ffe6LNNMoIS3b6D11","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2d5e267001xUB8wxVUMCODIt","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be925ffe6LNNMoIS3b6D11","messageID":"msg_1d2d5db54001s2pYawwYVm5Kxb","type":"tool","id":"call_c4f135a7ea154032b2cf5522","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\n\n### 12.7 Setup route and cost\n\n`/doctor:install` includes the embedder setup by default, and the setup itself runs as `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from inside the target repo. The route probes `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `advisor_status --include-semantic-health true`, prints one plan row per missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks once before it runs anything. A no stops with `STATUS=CANCELLED` and changes nothing. `--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\n\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\n\n| Measure | Value |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Disk for `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` | 274302450 bytes (261.6 MiB) |\n| Idle memory, `ollama serve` with no model loaded | 25776 KB (25.2 MiB) |\n| Loaded memory, model runner resident | 279520 KB (273.0 MiB) |\n| Unload after the last call | 5 minutes, Ollama keep-alive |\n| Warm embed latency, model loaded | 4.8 ms median, 8.9 ms p95 |\n| Cold first call after the unload | 538.53 ms |\n\nOnce the approved steps ran, the route runs `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`. That scan is what writes the command vectors into the `vec_cmd_<dim>` table: without it `commandVectorCoverage.embedded` stays at zero and the semantic lane reports off. The database is derived state and gitignored, since `.gitignore` ignores `runtime/database/*.sqlite`, so the scan costs its own runtime plus the warm latency per embedded prompt and leaves nothing for git.\n\n---\n\n## 13. RELATED RESOURCES","oldString":"- Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\n\n---\n\n## 13. RELATED RESOURCES","path":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\n@@ -366,8 +366,25 @@\n - Shared cascade: [`@spec-kit/shared/embeddings/auto-select.ts`](../system-spec-kit/shared/embeddings/auto-select.ts) — file-locked Ollama → hf-local → OpenAI → Voyage probe chain (ADR-014 local-first). Accepts optional `contentType: 'text' \\| 'code'` parameter (default `'text'`).\n - Skill-advisor schema helpers: [`runtime/lib/embedders/schema.ts`](./runtime/lib/embedders/schema.ts).\n - Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\n \n+### 12.7 Setup route and cost\n+\n+`/doctor:install` includes the embedder setup by default, and the setup itself runs as `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from inside the target repo. The route probes `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `advisor_status --include-semantic-health true`, prints one plan row per missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks once before it runs anything. A no stops with `STATUS=CANCELLED` and changes nothing. `--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\n+\n+What the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\n+\n+| Measure | Value |\n+| --- | ---: |\n+| Disk for `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` | 274302450 bytes (261.6 MiB) |\n+| Idle memory, `ollama serve` with no model loaded | 25776 KB (25.2 MiB) |\n+| Loaded memory, model runner resident | 279520 KB (273.0 MiB) |\n+| Unload after the last call | 5 minutes, Ollama keep-alive |\n+| Warm embed latency, model loaded | 4.8 ms median, 8.9 ms p95 |\n+| Cold first call after the unload | 538.53 ms |\n+\n+Once the approved steps ran, the route runs `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`. That scan is what writes the command vectors into the `vec_cmd_<dim>` table: without it `commandVectorCoverage.embedded` stays at zero and the semantic lane reports off. The database is derived state and gitignored, since `.gitignore` ignores `runtime/database/*.sqlite`, so the scan costs its own runtime plus the warm latency per embedded prompt and leaves nothing for git.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\n \n","status":"modified","additions":17,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\\n\\n### 12.7 Setup route and cost\\n\\n`/doctor:install` includes the embedder setup by default, and the setup itself runs as `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from inside the target repo. The route probes `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags` and `advisor_status --include-semantic-health true`, prints one plan row per missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks once before it runs anything. A no stops with `STATUS=CANCELLED` and changes nothing. `--dry-run` prints the plan and stops with `STATUS=OK`. The route never installs or upgrades Ollama: it prints the install command for the operator, and the install guide owns that cost.\\n\\nWhat the embedder costs on this machine, measured 2026-11-13 with `runtime/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`:\\n\\n| Measure | Value |\\n| --- | ---: |\\n| Disk for `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` | 274302450 bytes (261.6 MiB) |\\n| Idle memory, `ollama serve` with no model loaded | 25776 KB (25.2 MiB) |\\n| Loaded memory, model runner resident | 279520 KB (273.0 MiB) |\\n| Unload after the last call | 5 minutes, Ollama keep-alive |\\n| Warm embed latency, model loaded | 4.8 ms median, 8.9 ms p95 |\\n| Cold first call after the unload | 538.53 ms |\\n\\nOnce the approved steps ran, the route runs `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`. That scan is what writes the command vectors into the `vec_cmd_<dim>` table: without it `commandVectorCoverage.embedded` stays at zero and the semantic lane reports off. The database is derived state and gitignored, since `.gitignore` ignores `runtime/database/*.sqlite`, so the scan costs its own runtime plus the warm latency per embedded prompt and leaves nothing for git.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\",\"oldString\":\"- Architecture-gap follow-on: packet `003/006-shared-embedder-logic-with-spec-memory` (shipped phase 003/006).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\",\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538594919,"end":1794538599207}}}}
