gnores `runtime/database/*.sqlite`, so the scan costs its own runtime plus the warm latency per embedded prompt and leaves nothing for git.\n386: \n387: ---\n388: \n389: ## 13. RELATED RESOURCES\n390: \n391: | Document | Purpose |\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 392]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL-GUIDE.md\",\"offset\":364,\"limit\":28}"},"time":{"start":1794538606733,"end":1794538608907}}}}
